 get this thing going but I  need XYZ before that can happen  none of that is true you don't need 5000  you don't need 10,000 you don't need a  hundred bucks you don't need anything  you just need you and your hustle to  start talking to customers potential  customers understand what they need and  going and start solving problems don't  accept these limiting personal beliefs  that hold you back from being successful  because it's $5,000 now and then as you  grow it's gonna be something else it's  gonna be something else I'm not  successful because this  I'm not accessible because I don't have  that and it's never the case the only  thing holding you back is the story  you're telling yourself and the belief  that you have that it's holding you back  so what I would encourage you to do is a  couple things okay one go out and start  talking to potential customers don't  sell them anything just go out and start  talking to people people who you think  would be ideal clients for you okay so  if you're a photographer are you doing  graphic design you're probably talking  to business owners my go start talking  to them understand what their needs are  see if they can hire you for something  see if you can solve a problem for them  number two I'd go out and start modeling  success look at the people who've had  the most success in your industry and  see how they got started learn how they  got their first customer learn how they  went from nothing to making the first  million dollars and learn from people  who are not even in your industry learn  from people who will products learn from  people who've built software learn from  people who are in fashion look at the  six most successful entrepreneur that  you look up to whoever it is if it's  jay-z if it's Oprah if it's Donald Trump  whoever it is and look at how they got  started because they didn't have a ton  of money launching them they started  from nothing and their stories can both  inspire you to let you know that i